	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\nCALC - DC LINK\n  Bulk        3 x 100 uF = 300 uF (polymer, negligible DC derating)\n  MLCC        9 x 4u7 = 42.3 uF nominal\n              at 50 V DC bias, 1210 X7R ~= 0.4 -> 16.9 uF effective\n  Bus ripple  dV ~= Idc/(fsw x C) = [FILL]/( [FILL] x 316u) = [FILL] V\n  Ripple current requirement: [FILL] A RMS vs 3 x [FILL] A rated"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 97.79 53.34 0)
		(size 74.93 19.05)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
