	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\nCALC - CURRENT SENSE\n  Rshunt = 3 mR, bidirectional, VREF = 3.3 V, zero at 1.65 V\n    Gain 5  -> +/-110 A     Gain 20 -> +/-27.5 A\n    Gain 10 -> +/-55 A      Gain 40 -> +/-13.75 A\n  SELECTED: gain 20 V/V\n  ADC resolution at gain 20:\n    (3.3/4096) / 20 / 3 mR = 13.4 mA per LSB\n  Vsense at 20 A = 60 mV (within +/-1 V continuous spec)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
